%% title: Swimlane
%% alt: A swimlane diagram with agent, CI and you lanes: the agent pushes a change, CI tests it, and you review and merge it
swimlane-beta LR
  subgraph Agent
    branch[Make a worktree]
    code[Write the change]
    push[Push the branch]
  end

  subgraph CI
    test[Run the tests]
    green{Green?}
  end

  subgraph You
    review[Review the diff]
    merge[Merge]
  end

  branch --> code --> push --> test --> green
  green -->|no| code
  green -->|yes| review
  review -->|changes| code
  review -->|approve| merge
